        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bobby Tench, Marilyn Manson, Brian Hugh Warner, Jeff Beck, Max Middleton\n- Products: Rough and Ready\n- Roles: vocalist, guitarist, sideman, songwriter, arranger, singer, musician, composer, actor, painter, author, music journalist, keyboardist\n\nFacts:\n- Robert Tench is also known as Bobby Tench and is a British vocalist, guitarist, sideman, songwriter, and arranger.\n- Brian Hugh Warner was born on January 5, 1969 and is professionally known as Marilyn Manson.\n- Marilyn Manson is an American singer, songwriter, musician, composer, actor, painter, author, and former music journalist.\n- For the album Rough and Ready, Jeff Beck enlisted Bobby Tench as vocalist.\n- Rough and Ready is the first recording on which keyboardist Max Middleton is heard.",
